  "comments": {
    "q1-B": "Feels like the utilities should live in spell-server or a separate project -- e.g. the WWOD agent stuff could move into `spell-ui` as well.\n\n`spell-parser` is exotic and will be dodgy to some.  Having it as an import to spell-ui for markdown/highlighter is fine, but utils coming from there seems wrong."
